From 18f37199f04e30193021056670b31cdf98783e7c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Brenda Streiff <brenda.streiff@emerson.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Feb 2026 15:31:36 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] meta-mender-*: fix u-boot patches for i2c eeprom fix

commit daadd63be017 ("meta-ettus-bsp: u-boot: fix reading EEPROM") added
an item to the bootargs variable, resulting in these patches not applying
cleanly anymore. Update them.

Signed-off-by: Brenda Streiff <brenda.streiff@emerson.com>
---
 ...ni-zynq-Mender.io-support-for-NI-Ettus-Research-E31x.patch | 4 ++--
 ...ni-zynq-Mender.io-support-for-NI-Ettus-Research-Neon.patch | 4 ++--
 ...ni-zynq-Mender.io-support-for-NI-Ettus-Research-Neon.patch | 4 ++--
 ...ni-zynq-Mender.io-support-for-NI-Ettus-Research-Sulf.patch | 4 ++--
 4 files changed, 8 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/meta-mender-e31x/recipes-bsp/u-boot/files/0001-ni-zynq-Mender.io-support-for-NI-Ettus-Research-E31x.patch b/meta-mender-e31x/recipes-bsp/u-boot/files/0001-ni-zynq-Mender.io-support-for-NI-Ettus-Research-E31x.patch
